[{"title":"渡江二首 其二","author":"童轩","text":"长江天堑古今同，控引东南地势雄。\n几度桃花三月雨，锦云翻浪化鱼龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":44013,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和尚宝宋士皋先生春日符台即景之作 其一","author":"童轩","text":"忆昔先皇御太平，朝来前殿集群英。\n彩云飞动金舆出，两两霓旌作队行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":44014,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和尚宝宋士皋先生春日符台即景之作 其二","author":"童轩","text":"御路风清绝点埃，茸茸新绿剪莓苔。\n羽林环卫无人到，惟有中官日往来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":44015,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画松","author":"童轩","text":"曾是陶公手种来，山中风雨老莓苔。\n伫看贡入明堂用，还似当年宰相才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":44016,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄月溪瑩僧官二首 其一","author":"童轩","text":"病来常欲谢朝簪，几度怀师梦里寻。\n遥想跏趺双树底，一灯悬影照禅心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":44017,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄月溪瑩僧官二首 其二","author":"童轩","text":"白云芳草闭禅关，金磬无声夕照闲。\n应是定中忘坐久，袈裟浑染石苔斑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":44018,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"䳺鹑图","author":"童轩","text":"荆棘丛深旧路微，奔奔常向夕阳飞。\n长安此日看图画，应笑为儒百结衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":44019,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瞿谷图","author":"童轩","text":"性慧能言异众毛，云霄千里路劳劳。\n绿杨枝上东风软，却笑群飞燕雀高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":44020,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村居图","author":"童轩","text":"鸟外斜阳一水明，村居深掩数峰青。\n落花寂寂春归尽，载酒无人到草亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":44021,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宝带桥","author":"童轩","text":"宝带桥头水满矶，小舟双桨暮渔归。\n藕花蒲叶俱零落，惟见斜阳乳鸭飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":44022,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经沛县怀古","author":"童轩","text":"芒砀山前起白云，龙飞犹忆汉时君。\n高台芜没西风急，彷佛歌声入耳闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":44023,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿草萍驿","author":"童轩","text":"霜冷重衾梦不成，残灯留影伴离情。\n仆夫晨起催行色，茅店鸡声月正明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":44024,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟回采石夜泊谪仙楼下值雨弗果登楼用赋一诗以吊","author":"童轩","text":"谪仙楼下吊诗仙，千载风流世共怜。\n烟雨一江无月色，鲸鱼风起浪花圆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":44025,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山水图为姚宗仁题","author":"童轩","text":"落日青山映碧沙，平湖渺渺见星槎。\n桥边云树参差出，疑是青城隐士家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":44026,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题丁凤仪见赠二首 其一","author":"童轩","text":"曾见操觚试棘闱，少年文采似君稀。\n秋来应有梯云梦，桂子吹香堕绿衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":44027,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题丁凤仪见赠二首 其二","author":"童轩","text":"频年载笔侍明光，惭愧清时少谏章。\n空有丹心似孤鹤，时时飞绕海天长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":44028,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈文璧琼林醉归图二首 其一","author":"童轩","text":"璚林宴罢出南宫，罗袖飘香醉态浓。\n一色杏花三十里，长安道上马如龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":44029,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈文璧琼林醉归图二首 其二","author":"童轩","text":"帽压宫花照眼新，东风浑胜曲江春。\n醉中记得归时路，丹凤楼头月似银。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":44030,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夕有感","author":"童轩","text":"身世相违似陆沈，鬓边频见二毛侵。\n西风吹破还家梦，一夜寒螀伴苦吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":44031,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一榻清声墨竹二首为刘司勋先生题 其一","author":"童轩","text":"洒出金壶玉两枝，楚云湘水不胜奇。\n岁寒劲节谁能识，凭仗清风是故知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":44032,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一榻清声墨竹二首为刘司勋先生题 其二","author":"童轩","text":"碧云萧飒漏新晴，彷佛湘江一段清。\n夜静天风响林杪，满空飘下凤鸾声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":44033,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送蒋道士还茅山","author":"童轩","text":"黄冠野服列仙曹，天上朝元羽盖高。\n铁笛一声秋月白，又骑黄鹤下三茅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":44034,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双竹图","author":"童轩","text":"新粉含香并节生，翠云零乱不胜清。\n凭谁制作昭华管，听取雌雄两凤鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":44035,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题墨竹便面送郭判簿","author":"童轩","text":"丛碧分香出上林，清风高节等南金。\n相看犹带霜台操，肯向炎荒易素心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":44036,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵杨内翰宾筵留咏二首 其一","author":"童轩","text":"马首黄尘十丈飞，蓝袍今已化缁衣。\n相过只有扬雄宅，几共谈经坐夕晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path"